\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Fainting soul, be bold, be strong,
\par Wait the leisure of thy Lord;
\par Though it seem to tarry long,
\par True and faithful is His word:
\par On His word my soul I cast-
\par He cannot Himself deny;
\par Surely it shall speak at last;
\par It shall speak, and shall not lie.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Every one that seeks shall find,
\par Every one that asks shall have
\par Christ, the Saviour of mankind,
\par Willing, able, all to save;
\par I shall His salvation see,
\par I in faith on Jesus call,
\par I from sin shall be set free,
\par Perfectly set free from all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Lord, my time is in Thine hand,
\par Weak and helpless as I am,
\par Surely Thou canst make me stand;
\par I believe in Jesu's name:
\par Saviour in temptation Thou;
\par Thou hast saved me heretofore,
\par Thou from sin dost save me now,
\par Thou shalt save me evermore.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

